WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:04.218
Episode 13
Return

00:33.049 --> 00:34.812
This is too horrible...

00:34.884 --> 00:38.877
Someone he thought of so dearly being killed right before his eyes.

00:38.955 --> 00:43.255
And her killer was someone who was like a brother to him.

00:43.326 --> 00:45.089
What's going on here?

00:46.329 --> 00:49.958
And I left Kamui's side at such an important time...

00:50.033 --> 00:51.500
It's my wrongdoing.

00:52.836 --> 00:54.770
I'm partly responsible, too.

00:54.838 --> 00:57.966
I held you back in Kamakura.

00:58.041 --> 01:00.168
No, it's not that. I...

01:00.243 --> 01:01.733
Let's stop this.

01:01.811 --> 01:04.871
Right now, we need to think first of Kamui's future.

01:12.055 --> 01:12.856
Sumeragi

01:12.856 --> 01:15.689
Sumeragi Subaru, what is the matter?

01:16.893 --> 01:19.589
I'm sorry for calling so late.

01:19.663 --> 01:23.030
About my sister's seventh year ritual tomorrow...

01:23.099 --> 01:25.090
You can't make it, right?

01:25.168 --> 01:28.001
I can feel something's been going on.

01:29.239 --> 01:32.037
And that you would be calling.

01:33.109 --> 01:34.406
I see.

01:34.477 --> 01:35.774
I apologize.

01:35.845 --> 01:37.710
It couldn't be helped.

01:37.781 --> 01:42.150
You are a Dragon of Heaven, one of the Seven Seals.

01:43.753 --> 01:45.118
Subaru.

01:45.188 --> 01:49.488
The time your powers are needed has finally come.

01:50.627 --> 01:54.529
I ask you to do the best for my sister's service.

01:54.597 --> 01:56.087
I understand.

02:20.724 --> 02:21.656
There?

02:29.532 --> 02:31.397
You don't have to go in there!

02:31.468 --> 02:33.834
You don't need to clean that room.

02:33.903 --> 02:37.361
A long-term guest uses that room.

02:37.440 --> 02:39.271
All the more reason to clean.

02:39.342 --> 02:40.309
It's fine!

02:40.377 --> 02:43.210
The guest says it's not necessary.

02:43.279 --> 02:44.678
I see...

02:46.316 --> 02:48.181
What kind of guest is it?

02:48.251 --> 02:50.811
You don't have to know that.

02:50.887 --> 02:53.981
Come on, I want you to get downstairs.

02:54.057 --> 02:55.149
A-All right.

03:31.795 --> 03:33.422
I found you.

03:33.496 --> 03:36.693
You're the dreamseer that got in my way, aren't you?

03:45.375 --> 03:46.399
Your name?

03:47.477 --> 03:49.445
Kakyou Kuzuki.

03:51.881 --> 03:54.042
I have a message from that girl.

03:55.285 --> 03:57.253
I love both of them.

03:57.320 --> 03:58.787
And...

03:58.855 --> 04:01.517
...the future still hasn't been determined.

04:02.559 --> 04:06.256
The future still hasn't been determined.

04:06.329 --> 04:07.523
No.

04:07.597 --> 04:09.565
It's already been determined.

04:10.633 --> 04:13.500
The moment I became a Dragon of Earth.

04:15.405 --> 04:17.930
You should see that if you're a dreamseer.

04:20.443 --> 04:23.173
There is only one future.

04:32.622 --> 04:35.352
Trying to fool me with a dream...

04:35.425 --> 04:36.517
It's useless.

04:40.997 --> 04:42.965
What do you wish for?

04:44.033 --> 04:45.466
What is your wish?

04:47.470 --> 04:49.404
I see.
You want to die.

04:50.473 --> 04:53.169
I'll grant that wish someday.

04:53.243 --> 04:56.474
Until then, weave dreams for me.

04:59.182 --> 05:02.151
Finally, the other "Kamui" has awakened.

05:04.621 --> 05:07.988
An accompanying star born to fill the empty seat...

05:08.057 --> 05:11.993
...whichever side, heaven or earth, the true Kamui falls to.

05:13.062 --> 05:17.692
Kamui chose to be a Dragon of Heaven, one of the Seven Seals.

05:17.767 --> 05:20.167
So the other "Kamui" is mine.

05:21.504 --> 05:22.869
That is not so...

05:22.939 --> 05:25.772
The "Kamui" who is a Dragon of Earth...

05:25.842 --> 05:28.868
...one of the Seven Angels, is already close by.

05:28.945 --> 05:30.810
That is not so, Kanoe!

05:30.880 --> 05:35.874
Sister, I'll prove to you that your dreamgazing was correct.

05:35.952 --> 05:37.510
Kanoe!

05:37.587 --> 05:39.612
Don't invite "Kamui" within!

05:44.861 --> 05:46.328
He's coming.

05:46.396 --> 05:48.023
To where I am now.

05:57.941 --> 05:59.408
Kakyou.

05:59.475 --> 06:00.965
You can hear me, right?

06:02.378 --> 06:04.471
Where is the place I should head to?

06:44.821 --> 06:47.449
Satsuki, what is Beast's opinion?

06:48.591 --> 06:51.151
It answered that he is Kamui.

06:51.227 --> 06:52.125
I see.

06:53.196 --> 06:54.891
Rather unexpected.

06:54.964 --> 06:57.262
Yuto, what do you think?

06:58.334 --> 07:01.326
It's true that something inside me is reacting.

07:02.405 --> 07:04.600
They're both Dragons of Earth like me.

07:05.675 --> 07:09.668
But he seems different from the last time I saw him.

07:09.746 --> 07:11.236
Because he has awoken.

07:38.441 --> 07:39.533
Welcome.

07:44.113 --> 07:46.047
Nice to meet you, Kamui.

07:57.794 --> 07:59.284
I've been waiting for you.

08:00.363 --> 08:02.228
I'm worried about Kamui.

08:02.298 --> 08:05.927
His heart's wounds are much deeper than his body's.

08:06.002 --> 08:09.267
No matter who calls out to him, there's no reaction.

08:11.374 --> 08:12.636
Princess Hinoto,

08:12.709 --> 08:16.577
you knew that this was going to happen, right?

08:19.148 --> 08:22.515
This is also unavoidable destiny, isn't it?

08:22.585 --> 08:23.711
Lord Saiki.

08:23.786 --> 08:25.253
Yes.

08:25.321 --> 08:27.516
Kamui had two futures.

08:28.591 --> 08:32.550
A Dragon of Heaven's future and a Dragon of Earth's future.

08:32.628 --> 08:35.859
However, that girl only had one future.

08:36.933 --> 08:40.232
No matter which path Kamui chose...

08:40.303 --> 08:43.431
...there was no way to save that girl's life.

08:44.507 --> 08:47.169
If you had known that fact...

08:48.244 --> 08:50.804
...would you have told Kamui?

08:50.880 --> 08:51.812
No...

08:54.217 --> 08:55.184
Lord Saiki.

08:56.686 --> 08:59.621
Today, I found out for the first time...

08:59.689 --> 09:03.716
...just how hard it is to be able to see the future in dreams.

09:04.794 --> 09:09.026
Princess Hinoto, I understand what you are going through.

09:09.098 --> 09:10.565
No.

09:10.633 --> 09:14.160
Kamui's pain is even greater.

09:27.817 --> 09:29.842
No reaction whatsoever...

09:30.920 --> 09:33.047
...no matter how much we yell.

09:33.122 --> 09:36.148
Is there a chance he may never regain consciousness?

09:36.225 --> 09:38.090
Can't say that it's impossible.

09:38.161 --> 09:40.823
Never regain consciousness?

09:40.897 --> 09:42.421
He'll just stay like that...

09:44.267 --> 09:46.758
Not seeing or hearing anything.

09:46.836 --> 09:49.066
Clammed up in his heart forever.

09:50.139 --> 09:51.606
T-That can't be!

10:16.065 --> 10:17.430
Subaru.

10:17.500 --> 10:19.331
What are you trying to do?

10:19.402 --> 10:21.199
I'm going inside Kamui.

10:21.270 --> 10:22.794
Inside Kamui?

10:22.872 --> 10:25.102
You're going to dive inside his heart?

10:25.174 --> 10:28.735
Diving into a chaotic consciousness is too risky!

10:28.811 --> 10:30.005
I see...

10:30.079 --> 10:32.741
...the Sumeragi clan's secret techniques.

10:32.815 --> 10:36.410
But fail and your consciousness will sink down there, too.

10:36.485 --> 10:38.112
I know that.

10:38.187 --> 10:39.882
And you don't mind?

10:39.956 --> 10:41.321
There's no other way.

10:43.392 --> 10:46.452
Noubou akyasha kyarabaya
on arikiya maribori sowaka.

10:46.529 --> 10:49.589
Noubou akyasha kyarabaya
on arikiya maribori sowaka.

10:49.665 --> 10:52.691
Noubou akyasha kyarabaya
on arikiya maribori sowaka.

10:52.768 --> 10:55.703
Noubou akyasha kyarabaya
on arikiya maribori sowaka.

10:55.771 --> 10:58.569
Noubou akyasha kyarabaya
on arikiya maribori sowaka.

10:58.641 --> 11:02.907
Noubou akyasha kyarabaya
on arikiya maribori sowaka.

11:02.979 --> 11:05.607
Subaru, I'm trusting Kamui with you.

11:05.681 --> 11:07.740
Please bring him back.

11:07.817 --> 11:10.615
Noubou akyasha kyarabaya
on arikiya maribori sowaka.

11:10.686 --> 11:13.348
Noubou akyasha kyarabaya
on arikiya maribori sowaka.

11:13.422 --> 11:15.947
Noubou akyasha kyarabaya
on arikiya maribori sowaka.

11:16.025 --> 11:18.585
Noubou akyasha kyarabaya
on arikiya maribori sowaka.

12:00.503 --> 12:01.936
Subaru!

12:02.004 --> 12:05.269
Kamui's consciousness is denying the entry.

12:05.341 --> 12:08.003
He's not letting anyone get in easily.

12:18.754 --> 12:19.846
This is...

12:23.225 --> 12:24.852
Kamui's memories...

12:27.697 --> 12:29.927
Such a good voice, Kamui.

12:29.999 --> 12:30.966
Fuma...

12:31.033 --> 12:33.524
Do you know what you're doing right now?

12:33.602 --> 12:35.069
Of course.

12:35.137 --> 12:38.038
The Earth longs for a revolution.

12:38.107 --> 12:41.668
A revolution that humans will not get in the way of.

12:42.745 --> 12:47.773
I'll become a Dragon of Earth, kill all of the Dragons of Heaven,

12:47.850 --> 12:50.512
and wipe out all those who pollute the Earth.

12:50.586 --> 12:53.555
T-There's something wrong with you, Fuma...

12:55.591 --> 12:57.786
This is our destiny.

13:02.698 --> 13:04.097
Big brother...

13:05.334 --> 13:06.665
Don't, Kamui!

13:08.738 --> 13:10.171
Don't look anymore!

13:12.208 --> 13:14.676
Fuma!

13:19.482 --> 13:21.074
Subaru...

13:21.150 --> 13:23.084
N-No good?

13:39.368 --> 13:40.460
Kamui.

13:42.304 --> 13:43.271
Kotori...

13:43.339 --> 13:44.431
Fuma...

13:49.211 --> 13:51.475
Can I go over there?

13:51.547 --> 13:53.742
I'm Subaru Sumeragi.

13:53.816 --> 13:56.148
I want to talk to you.

13:56.218 --> 13:58.743
No, I don't want to talk.

14:00.089 --> 14:02.023
I'm going over there.

14:02.091 --> 14:03.023
All right?

14:06.529 --> 14:10.431
Don't kill Kotori and Fuma.

14:10.499 --> 14:11.431
Please.

14:13.202 --> 14:14.635
Don't kill them.

14:21.811 --> 14:23.301
Kamui.

14:23.379 --> 14:25.210
It's not good to stay like this.

14:25.281 --> 14:26.179
Let's talk.

14:27.249 --> 14:29.149
I said no...

14:29.218 --> 14:30.651
Go over there.

14:30.719 --> 14:32.346
I don't want to...

14:36.125 --> 14:38.025
Go over there.

14:38.094 --> 14:39.857
Listen, Kamui.

14:39.929 --> 14:41.760
No!

14:45.201 --> 14:47.169
Going further is dangerous.

14:47.236 --> 14:48.533
I know.

14:48.604 --> 14:51.095
- I know, but...
- Hurry! Stop him!

14:56.712 --> 14:58.475
Subaru, that's enough!

14:58.547 --> 14:59.912
You've done plenty!

15:01.250 --> 15:02.945
K-Kamui...

15:14.497 --> 15:16.226
Kamui...

15:16.298 --> 15:17.890
Listen closely.

15:20.269 --> 15:22.794
As long as you stay in your dream...

15:22.872 --> 15:26.171
...nothing will start, and nothing will end.

15:27.276 --> 15:30.677
Right now, you're at the bottom of your heart.

15:32.281 --> 15:37.014
You're running away from reality because you faced hardship.

15:38.120 --> 15:40.611
The situation will only get worse...

15:40.689 --> 15:42.953
...just like it did for me.

15:43.025 --> 15:44.959
I was the same as you.

15:46.028 --> 15:47.757
Look at that.

16:07.016 --> 16:08.074
Who is that?

16:08.150 --> 16:10.311
My one and only elder sister.

16:10.386 --> 16:12.946
And Seishirou Sakurazuka.

16:14.023 --> 16:16.856
They were both people dear to me.

16:17.927 --> 16:19.758
Dear to you?

16:19.828 --> 16:20.920
Yes.

16:20.996 --> 16:25.330
Seishirou especially was someone very special to me.

16:25.401 --> 16:26.299
But...

16:31.006 --> 16:34.407
This is my memory, so you won't make it in time.

16:43.919 --> 16:46.012
When my sister was killed...

16:46.088 --> 16:48.386
...I couldn't do anything.

16:49.458 --> 16:55.021
I was running away from reality, clammed up inside my own heart.

16:55.097 --> 16:57.088
Just like you are now.

16:58.167 --> 16:59.429
Kamui...

16:59.501 --> 17:01.935
It's all right to stay here forever.

17:02.004 --> 17:04.973
If that's what makes you happiest.

17:06.275 --> 17:10.041
But as long as you don't get out of here...

17:10.112 --> 17:13.570
...nothing will start, and nothing will end.

17:13.649 --> 17:14.741
Just like me...

17:14.817 --> 17:18.253
...in truly important times, all you can do is watch.

17:18.320 --> 17:19.947
You can't do anything.

17:21.023 --> 17:25.517
Someone dear to me was killed by someone dear to me, too.

17:25.594 --> 17:30.054
But I was able to return to reality from the pain in my heart.

17:30.132 --> 17:33.329
To turn the future I dream of into reality.

17:34.637 --> 17:41.270
I'm sure that it will only make the people I love sad,

17:41.343 --> 17:44.312
but I can't change my wish.

17:45.714 --> 17:50.742
Is that because the one that killed someone dear to you...

17:50.819 --> 17:52.309
...is someone special?

17:57.259 --> 17:58.726
That's right.

17:58.794 --> 18:01.285
So you should choose, as well.

18:02.364 --> 18:05.891
Whether to continue blaming yourself in your memories...

18:05.968 --> 18:08.459
...or to return to reality with a wish.

18:09.972 --> 18:12.600
Don't you have something you want to wish for?

18:12.675 --> 18:14.870
Something to wish for?

18:14.943 --> 18:18.003
If I wish it, anything can come true?

18:18.080 --> 18:20.105
I'm not sure about that.

18:20.182 --> 18:24.448
But nothing can be done if you don't wish for it.

18:24.520 --> 18:28.149
From here, you need to return to the real world...

18:28.223 --> 18:31.090
...and do it yourself.

18:32.161 --> 18:33.594
What's wrong?

18:33.662 --> 18:38.565
I used a little too much of my powers...

18:38.634 --> 18:39.931
You're going to die?

18:41.003 --> 18:42.095
Kamui...

18:44.006 --> 18:46.975
If you have something to wish for...

18:48.043 --> 18:49.840
If you have hopes...

18:50.879 --> 18:52.938
...come back.

18:59.755 --> 19:00.722
Subaru!

19:00.789 --> 19:02.654
- Missie, get the doctor!
- Right!

19:05.527 --> 19:06.926
Subaru...

19:06.995 --> 19:09.691
I did everything I could.

19:10.766 --> 19:13.200
There's nothing else.

19:14.269 --> 19:15.634
I know.

19:15.704 --> 19:17.069
You did your best.

19:17.139 --> 19:18.766
That's enough.

19:18.841 --> 19:20.138
Sorry.

19:20.209 --> 19:24.043
Let me rest like this for a while...

19:27.716 --> 19:30.048
I'm the one who's sorry...

19:30.119 --> 19:32.553
making you go through such pain.

19:56.445 --> 19:57.537
Sorata...

20:03.452 --> 20:05.079
K-Kamui...

20:19.268 --> 20:20.860
I'm back.

20:20.936 --> 20:22.870
Thanks, Subaru.

20:31.079 --> 20:34.207
I couldn't protect Kotori.

20:35.751 --> 20:38.117
So at least... Fuma...

20:39.455 --> 20:41.889
I want to bring Fuma back.

20:41.957 --> 20:43.720
That's...

20:43.792 --> 20:45.054
...my wish.
